<Base title="Privacy — Kurian Benny" description="How contact enquiries and website analytics are handled on Kurian Benny’s website."><section class="wrap section article"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY / ENQUIRIES & ANALYTICS</p><h1>Your enquiry.<br /><em>Handled thoughtfully.</em></h1><div class="prose"><h2>Information you choose to share</h2><p>The contact form asks for your name, email address, optional phone number and service of interest, and message so I can understand and respond to your enquiry. Please include only information relevant to your project.</p><h2>Contact form processing</h2><p>When enabled, the form submits directly to FormSubmit, which processes the enquiry and delivers it to my configured email address. FormSubmit handles human verification using reCAPTCHA. Its processing is governed by <a href="https://formsubmit.co/privacy.pdf">FormSubmit’s privacy policy</a>.</p><h2>Other contact channels</h2><p>Opening WhatsApp, GitHub, or LinkedIn takes you to those services, which apply their own privacy policies.</p><h2>Website hosting</h2><p>This is a static website hosted on GitHub Pages. It has no visitor accounts. Fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, and your browser may connect to Google to display them.</p><h2>Website analytics</h2><p>This website uses Microsoft Clarity on its public GitHub Pages domain to understand how visitors navigate pages, using heatmaps and session recordings. Clarity processes browsing interactions and device information and may use cookies depending on consent and project settings. The contact form is explicitly masked from recordings. Microsoft’s processing is described in the <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/en-us/privacystatement">Microsoft Privacy Statement</a>.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>You can reach me through the contact channels listed on the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. While those details are placeholders, use <a href="https://github.com/kurianbenny">my GitHub profile</a>.</p></div></section></Base>
